   "id": "edge-register",
   "name": "Edge-triggered register",
   "model": "table",
   "summary": "Stores one bit, captured only at the moment the Clock lever turns on.",
   "lesson": [
    "Two locked-repeater stages sit in a row: the first listens while Clock is off, the second while Clock is on.",
    "When Clock turns on, the first stage locks and the second passes on what the first captured.",
    "Changing Data while Clock stays on or off cannot reach the lamp.",
    "So the lamp only changes at a rising Clock edge."
   ],
